PROJECT: CHOICE PROPERTIES — AI RENTAL INQUIRY ASSISTANT, CUSTOMER MEMORY, AND CONVERSATION MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

I want you to inspect my existing Choice Properties project and build a dedicated AI Rental Inquiry Assistant inside the project.

Do not treat this as a simple chatbot. I need a persistent customer relationship and conversation-management system that helps me respond to rental inquiries, remembers each customer’s information and previous conversations, and consistently follows the customer-service procedures, communication style, and business policies established in this project.

Before making changes, inspect the existing repository, application architecture, database, authentication, AI integrations, and deployment configuration. Identify the best way to integrate this feature into the current project without breaking existing functionality.

Do not immediately start coding without first understanding the existing project structure and data flow. Once the architecture is understood, implement the feature using the most suitable approach for the existing application.

