1. PRIMARY OBJECTIVE
    ==================================================

Build a dedicated section inside Choice Properties where I can manage customer inquiries and use AI to generate appropriate responses based on:

* The customer’s current message.
* Their previous messages and conversations.
* Their saved rental preferences.
* Their application and payment status, when available.
* Their property interests.
