It should answer the eviction question directly, acknowledge the relevant information, and avoid asking for the customer’s bedroom preference, location, budget, and move-in timeframe again.

If the customer later changes their budget, update the profile without deleting the original conversation.

Maintain an activity history so I can see when and why information changed.

